[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふううう……終わった～……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pheeew... We did it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "目立ったミスもなかったし、良かったんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No major slip-ups either. I'd say that went pretty well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "観客のみんなも盛り上がってくれていたようでござる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The audience seemed to love every moment of it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "三人とも、素晴らしいライブでしたわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All three of you put on a wonderful show!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "社長殿！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Director!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トップバッターという大役、\n見事に果たしてみせましたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Opening the festival is no small task, and you pulled it off brilliantly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ええ。これで思い残すことはありませぬ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes. I have no regrets."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……やだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...No."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで終わりなんてやだ！\n辞めないで……もっと一緒にアイドルやりたい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't want this to be the end! Please don't go... I want to keep doing this together..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ……すまぬ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna... I'm sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……謝らないで。わがままだって分かってるから……\nでも……うっ、ぐす……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Don't apologize. I know I'm being selfish... but... I can't help it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実はね、ライブの前にヨハナや社長と話してたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, I talked with Johanna and the director before the show."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今後、『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』を\nどうするのかって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "About what's going to happen to Cutie☆AnimalL going forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！\u3000どうするつもりなのだ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...And? What did you decide?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "辞めないよ。二人になっても活動を続ける",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're not quitting. We'll keep going, even as a duo."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』はなくならない。\nだから……戻りたくなったら、いつでも戻って来てよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cutie☆AnimalL isn't going anywhere. So... whenever you want to come back, just come back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシたち、待ってるから……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll be waiting for you...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……ありがとう、みんな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you... everyone..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さ、フェスはまだ終わっていませんわ。\n幕が下りるまで、大いに楽しみましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, the festival isn't over yet. Let's enjoy every last moment until the curtain falls."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ！\u3000今年も残すところ１分を切りました！\nカウントダウンのご用意を！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright! Less than one minute left in the year! Get ready to count it down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "司会",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "司会"
        }
      }
    }
  },
